# Search noise filter: read by ripgrep, Claude Code's Grep and fd (token plan task 5).
# It hides generated files from SEARCH only; git, builds, tests and the Read tool never look at
# it. To search a hidden path on purpose, name it (rg foo graphify-out/cache/).

# Graph data. GRAPH_SUMMARY.md is the one file agents search.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_SUMMARY.md

# Cargo and wasm-pack build output.
target/
/beebeeb-wasm/pkg/

# Generated UniFFI bindings and the xcframework (build-ios.sh / build-android.sh write them).
/bindings/
/beebeeb-uniffi/bindings/
/BeebeebCore.xcframework/
